From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 02:26:32 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 060/230] Make the Adsgram Task card the only ad unit and take
 its reward webhook
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adsgram ships no banner format — only Task, Reward and Interstitial — so the
<AdBanner> slots built for a format that does not exist are gone, snippet TODO
and all. Every placement now goes through the Task card, gated by one switch:
it renders only when ADGRAM_ENABLED is exactly "true", a task-… block id is in
VITE_ADSGRAM_TASK_BLOCK_ID and the app is inside Telegram. On Matchday it now
sits below the Upcoming feed and above Previous results, so an ad can never
push the fixtures out of view; Match detail keeps it as the last block. Task
completions are reported to a new unauthenticated GET /api/adsgram/reward,
which answers 200 { status: "ok" } so Adsgram keeps the callback alive and logs
the userId — crediting the reward is deliberately left for later.

